# GRUB SHIFT: buying SEED, then dropping a third pod on a tile blows it into a sinkhole.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat shop 0 15
cheat energy 2
cheat buy 0 3
expect chip3 == 15
expect energy == 0
cheat pods 5 1 2
cheat bug 6 1 3 0
cheat use 3 5 1
expect hole_at51 == 1
expect kills == 1
expect status == 0
